1. She has a dog that she takes to the vet every six months for a checkup. (Verbatim: "I had to take my dog to the vet yesterday, um, for her regular checkup. She gets one every six months...")

2. Her dog is slightly overweight, which she attributes to "winter fat" and overfeeding treats. (Verbatim: "She's just a tiny, tiny, tiny, tiny, tiny, tiny bit overweight. Um, I think she gained some, uh, winter, winter fat.")

3. She has a habit of giving her dog many treats, especially when the dog performs tricks. (Verbatim: "on the weekend, I gave her a heckin' ton of treats... when she does the tricks, I want to give her the treats.")

4. She grew up eating Magic Stars (chocolate star-shaped snacks with faces) and used to sort them by face, believing the cuter ones tasted better. (Verbatim: "I used to pick out the one with the sunglasses and the one that has the cute eyes and put them aside... apparently the cuter the faces, the yummier it would be.")

5. She considers Magic Stars her "adult breakfast," indicating a nostalgic fondness for the snack. (Verbatim: "This is my adult breakfast today.")

6. She lives in the UK and recently received a new post-Brexit British passport. (Verbatim: "my old passport was pre, was pre Brexit... Now I have this new one and it's a different colour and it's different inside.")

7. She owns only one large bowl suitable for eating, which she often forgets to wash promptly. (Verbatim: "I only have one big bowl... I put the bowl in the dishwasher. I didn't turn the dishwasher on last night.")

8. She finds it difficult to buy new bowls because she wants to physically feel and assess their quality before purchasing. (Verbatim: "I have to actually go feel it like cloves, I guess.")

9. She aspires to travel to Japan and host streams from there, now that she has her new passport. (Verbatim: "now I can book I can book Japan we can go to Japan let's go Japan... I'll be in japan I'll make sure we have a ton of fun fun streams")

10. She struggles with managing gift notifications on her activity feed and often misses thanking donors during streams. (Verbatim: "my activities feed weakness is gifts... it doesn't actually proper tell me so you're gonna get thank yous next to stream") [end of text]



